# Samsung AI Consultant: derived query-embedding cache for retrieval evaluation (regenerable)
projects/samsung-ai-consultant/evaluation/results/query_embeddings.json

# n8n backups/exports of the temporary evaluation-only workflows (Phase 3D): redundant with the committed
